{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"little-hens-big-sneeze","version":1,"title":"Little Hen’s Big Sneeze","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Little Hen woke with a tickle in her nose. ‘Ah… ah… ah… ATCHOO!’ she sneezed.","sentences":["Little Hen woke with a tickle in her nose.","‘Ah… ah… ah… ATCHOO!’ she sneezed."],"image":"sha256:90e8f02ceef55f43df0918d6a7f035d56d277c0ded5207c396aca040051c6b97","alt":"A small brown hen sneezes with her beak wide open in a sunny farmyard.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:c7207397c1086de12378ee8801f22e60d33d4fa00334828fbf114327730e8bc7","durationMs":8680,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3945],[3945,8680]],"words":[[0,526],[526,789],[789,1140],[1140,1491],[1491,1666],[1666,2192],[2192,2367],[2367,2630],[2630,3945],[3945,4559],[4559,5173],[5173,5787],[5787,7278],[7278,7541],[7541,8680]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"The sneeze was so loud that Goat jumped. ‘Meh!’ he said. He landed in the washing basket.","sentences":["The sneeze was so loud that Goat jumped.","‘Meh!’ he said.","He landed in the washing basket."],"image":"sha256:6944b83a34de61975eb7d8608d0cb9efd5aa3b5a48a0bd2418bf1a0e87426938","alt":"A surprised goat sits in a laundry basket with a sock on his horn.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:b3081fd18c2b876ef23cbd110179470d08d2989165af1adb7a3cd02a43aafa26","durationMs":9120,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3699],[3699,6367],[6367,9120]],"words":[[0,258],[258,774],[774,1032],[1032,1204],[1204,1548],[1548,1892],[1892,2236],[2236,3699],[3699,4904],[4904,5076],[5076,6367],[6367,6539],[6539,7055],[7055,7227],[7227,7485],[7485,8087],[8087,9120]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Goat’s jump made Dog bark. ‘Woof, woof!’ said Dog. He ran in a circle.","sentences":["Goat’s jump made Dog bark.","‘Woof, woof!’ said Dog.","He ran in a circle."],"image":"sha256:753b747d0e2065d69eea9195e82bf447bc67d34e04ee64f95ec272a3c2f74113","alt":"A tan dog barks and spins in a circle with ears flying.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:abdaf409156ca3ee4ee084c2ee0d3e4dd5f003f0b911e3491112b8dfffcac48c","durationMs":7680,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2534],[2534,5966],[5966,7680]],"words":[[0,409],[409,736],[736,1063],[1063,1308],[1308,2534],[2534,3269],[3269,4495],[4495,4822],[4822,5966],[5966,6129],[6129,6374],[6374,6537],[6537,6700],[6700,7680]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Dog’s barking made Duck flap. ‘Quack, quack!’ said Duck. Feathers flew everywhere.","sentences":["Dog’s barking made Duck flap.","‘Quack, quack!’ said Duck.","Feathers flew everywhere."],"image":"sha256:f939ea2765c7efad9fda47bbf2fd05f993ea75ff5f60e9465d81846d7dd02e32","alt":"A white duck flaps her wings and feathers float through the air.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:b954692366e09f0f291efda5bd7511376d03de1c84af3f6379e5c132a2ed057f","durationMs":8400,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2670],[2670,6203],[6203,8400]],"words":[[0,314],[314,864],[864,1178],[1178,1492],[1492,2670],[2670,3455],[3455,4711],[4711,5025],[5025,6203],[6203,6831],[6831,7145],[7145,8400]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Little Hen’s nose tickled again. ‘Ah… ah… ah… ATCHOO!’ Everyone jumped again!","sentences":["Little Hen’s nose tickled again.","‘Ah… ah… ah… ATCHOO!’ Everyone jumped again!"],"image":"sha256:b5d8459f8cf6570c4e069179738d1f2153a2112f35a103bdbdd44b71103a7c84","alt":"The hen sneezes again and the goat, dog and duck all jump in surprise.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:ec16dba664a24343fb6b60adb9b24ef21d566f3d5fd2dbda6af775352ad89bea","durationMs":8880,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3286],[3286,8880]],"words":[[0,533],[533,888],[888,1243],[1243,1865],[1865,3286],[3286,3908],[3908,4530],[4530,5152],[5152,6662],[6662,7372],[7372,7905],[7905,8880]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"A tiny chick named Pipi looked closely. ‘There is dust on your beak,’ said Pipi. ‘I will fan it away.’","sentences":["A tiny chick named Pipi looked closely.","‘There is dust on your beak,’ said Pipi.","‘I will fan it away.’"],"image":"sha256:c666ccdc6f83f0790f8b1f86309280c566fa07226efccda0205bfd3d1e22607c","alt":"A tiny yellow chick holds a big green leaf and looks up at the hen’s beak.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:c9f66908d2480ef5803098fdb616f714ce80810832501b4cccd3ee6d981cce96","durationMs":8800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3520],[3520,7120],[7120,8800]],"words":[[0,160],[160,480],[480,880],[880,1280],[1280,1600],[1600,2080],[2080,3520],[3520,3920],[3920,4080],[4080,4400],[4400,4560],[4560,4880],[4880,5600],[5600,5920],[5920,7120],[7120,7280],[7280,7600],[7600,7840],[7840,8000],[8000,8800]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Swish, swish, swish! The dust blew away. Everybody waited. Ah… ah… ah… Nothing! No sneeze.","sentences":["Swish, swish, swish!","The dust blew away.","Everybody waited.","Ah… ah… ah… Nothing!","No sneeze."],"image":"sha256:d7ba29ab47c89ded1040530e382916e881ac5889c36aee88fe0de4c8ee222cfe","alt":"The chick fans the hen with a leaf while the goat, dog and duck watch with wide eyes.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:7f883b372d9fb3d0313c4900a94db918c7cd9b9b2318debfc91a26fd338f85a0","durationMs":14080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3596],[3596,6192],[6192,8789],[8789,12683],[12683,14080]],"words":[[0,999],[999,1998],[1998,3596],[3596,3896],[3896,4295],[4295,4694],[4694,6192],[6192,7091],[7091,8789],[8789,9488],[9488,10187],[10187,10886],[10886,12683],[12683,12883],[12883,14080]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Little Hen smiled. ‘Thank you, Pipi!’ Goat, Dog and Duck laughed together. The end.","sentences":["Little Hen smiled.","‘Thank you, Pipi!’ Goat, Dog and Duck laughed together.","The end."],"image":"sha256:db8f87772c236f6337a806b20df42dcf10cdf8c45847e085a0343ca56a13c41f","alt":"The hen, goat, dog, duck and chick laugh together in the yard.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:aaa26e